## Runas genéricas: instanciación nominal y funciones que devuelven instancias.
import std.spark

rune Cell shard T:
    value as T

enchanting Cell shard T:
    weave get into T:
        return self.value


## Función genérica que devuelve una aplicación nominal.
weave wrap shard T with x as T into Cell of T:
    var cell as Cell of T is with value is x
    return cell

weave main into int:
    var c as Cell of int is calling wrap of int with 7
    calling spark.assert with (calling c.get) == 7
    calling spark.println with "generics_nominal OK"
    return 0
